  // organization-config.yaml sourceFile at seed.ts:loadFile).
  // G-CT-2 is D-08 explicit-null (Dashboard is Console-only); also in
  // family-ranker's EXTRACTOR_EXPLICITLY_NULLED skip-list per D-14.
